From: Felix Krueckel <hi@felkru.com>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 02:46:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 36/52] Local model server option for the host app's AI in
 embedded builds

Adds `host.ai.local_model` (empty by default) and `host.ai.local_server` (LM Studio's
http://127.0.0.1:1234/v1) with rows under AI provider. With a local model set, the host app sends
#, Next Command and Prompt Suggestions to that OpenAI-compatible server instead of OpenRouter,
so terminal context stays on the machine.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
